# CORRECTNESS-E2E-01 F01: 2.3 LEFT 1.5 shows 1.52.3 and must error
# Two adjacent number nodes render as one numeral; the value computed must be
# the value displayed. Assert-only (no screenshot, no golden, no CI wiring).
wait 200
open_app Calculation
wait 60
set_angle_mode rad
key ac
key ac
key 2
key .
key 3
key left
key 1
key .
key 5
wait 3
key enter
wait 120
assert_app Calculation
assert_calc_status parse_error
